<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine vegoil export prices July 10.</title>
<headline>Argentine vegoil export prices July 10.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine vegoil export offer/bid prices were as follows, traders said. (FOB in U.S. dollars per tonne, or basis nearby CBOT contract).</p>
<p>     Soy oil    Jul ---/--- Aug 523/519  Sep +150/+140</p>
<p>		    Oct/Nov/Dec +145/+110</p>
<p>     Sunoil     Jul ---/--- Aug 525/519 Sep 524/518.5</p>
<p>		    Mar/Apr 500/485</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
